1
00:01:42,920 --> 00:01:44,480
You're quite loyal.

2
00:01:45,359 --> 00:01:47,280
If I ever get arrested,

3
00:01:48,359 --> 00:01:50,159
would you, just like today,

4
00:01:50,280 --> 00:01:51,319
plead for me?

5
00:01:51,760 --> 00:01:53,159
You won't get arrested.

6
00:02:05,159 --> 00:02:06,200
I still have things to take care of,

7
00:02:06,200 --> 00:02:07,519
so I won't leave with you.

8
00:02:11,199 --> 00:02:13,759
Don't worry, I won't make it hard for him.

9
00:02:50,919 --> 00:02:52,080
Who do you think you are?

10
00:02:55,319 --> 00:02:57,400
I'm trying to save you right now.

11
00:02:58,159 --> 00:02:59,560
When can we expect new findings?

12
00:02:59,560 --> 00:03:01,520
What's your boss from Taiwan, China doing?

13
00:03:01,639 --> 00:03:03,080
You must confess every single detail.

14
00:03:03,080 --> 00:03:03,759
Where is he right now?

15
00:03:03,759 --> 00:03:04,840
Have there been any new leads lately?

16
00:03:04,840 --> 00:03:06,479
Where do you think he is right now?

17
00:03:06,479 --> 00:03:07,520
Do you love him?

18
00:03:07,759 --> 00:03:09,599
I know everything you do.

19
00:03:09,599 --> 00:03:10,840
Don't lie to me.

20
00:03:16,080 --> 00:03:17,080
Something's wrong with Qiutian.

21
00:03:17,680 --> 00:03:18,800
Seems to be sick.

22
00:03:19,400 --> 00:03:20,039
Short of breath.

23
00:03:21,439 --> 00:03:22,360
Is he having trouble breathing?

24
00:03:23,000 --> 00:03:23,840
Should we head over?

25
00:03:25,280 --> 00:03:26,360
I'm just worried, just in case.

26
00:04:37,759 --> 00:04:39,839
Can you find someone with solid connections

27
00:04:40,560 --> 00:04:41,680
to get him a heavier sentence?

28
00:04:42,199 --> 00:04:42,759
A heavy sentence?

29
00:04:42,759 --> 00:04:43,439
How heavy?

30
00:04:43,800 --> 00:04:45,519
How about twenty years?

31
00:04:46,800 --> 00:04:48,040
For a robbery,

32
00:04:48,040 --> 00:04:49,519
can the sentence really be that long?

33
00:04:50,839 --> 00:04:52,519
If he steals a watch today,

34
00:04:52,839 --> 00:04:54,279
he might kill someone tomorrow.

35
00:04:54,279 --> 00:04:55,560
I definitely want him put away,

36
00:04:55,800 --> 00:04:56,879
the longer the sentence, the better.

37
00:04:56,879 --> 00:04:57,839
We must abide by the law.

38
00:04:58,600 --> 00:05:00,360
We certainly can't interfere with the court,

39
00:05:00,360 --> 00:05:01,600
but I know how to interpret the law.

40
00:05:01,600 --> 00:05:03,279
Higher value means a heavier sentence.

41
00:05:03,480 --> 00:05:06,240
What if your watch is a limited edition,

42
00:05:06,240 --> 00:05:08,600
discontinued, or an auction piece?

43
00:05:10,920 --> 00:05:12,279
I can sign a contract with you

44
00:05:12,720 --> 00:05:13,639
to triple the price.

45
00:05:13,639 --> 00:05:14,199
Make it eight times.

46
00:05:16,079 --> 00:05:17,079
Will the court believe that?

47
00:05:17,199 --> 00:05:18,000
Of course not.

48
00:05:18,519 --> 00:05:20,079
But it can serve as a key reference.

49
00:05:20,079 --> 00:05:20,839
Even if it's discounted,

50
00:05:20,839 --> 00:05:21,600
that's still four times.

51
00:05:21,759 --> 00:05:22,800
If you just say three times,

52
00:05:22,920 --> 00:05:23,480
and they cut it in half,

53
00:05:23,480 --> 00:05:24,560
it's down to one and a half.

54
00:05:28,639 --> 00:05:29,399
Let's do that.

55
00:05:30,199 --> 00:05:31,759
When do we sign? Tomorrow?

56
00:05:32,279 --> 00:05:33,720
We're discussing business tomorrow anyway.

57
00:05:33,720 --> 00:05:34,240
By the way,

58
00:05:34,639 --> 00:05:35,839
regarding our recent business,

59
00:05:35,839 --> 00:05:37,199
don't tell He Chunxiao yet.

60
00:05:39,839 --> 00:05:41,120
The kid has grown ambitious.

61
00:05:41,120 --> 00:05:42,040
He thinks his wings are fully grown.

62
00:05:42,040 --> 00:05:42,920
He wants to go solo.

63
00:05:46,920 --> 00:05:47,480
Understood.

64
00:07:21,360 --> 00:07:22,079
Did you find anything?

65
00:07:22,079 --> 00:07:23,160
What's this guy's background?

66
00:07:27,800 --> 00:07:29,399
Isn't there a special operation going on?

67
00:07:29,480 --> 00:07:30,399
They won't grow any bigger anyway.

68
00:07:30,639 --> 00:07:32,319
Why bother raising small fish like this?

69
00:07:45,199 --> 00:07:45,879
Jin Lina.

70
00:07:55,720 --> 00:07:56,439
Go ahead.

71
00:07:57,439 --> 00:07:58,240
What did you want to see me about

72
00:07:58,759 --> 00:07:59,959
that couldn't be said over the phone?

73
00:08:01,199 --> 00:08:02,519
I came to see Sis Xia earlier today.

74
00:08:03,240 --> 00:08:05,000
You must put down a deposit to work here.

75
00:08:06,319 --> 00:08:07,360
I can't scrape together enough right now.

76
00:08:07,759 --> 00:08:09,360
They said if someone vouches for me,

77
00:08:09,360 --> 00:08:10,600
I wouldn't have to pay it.

78
00:08:13,639 --> 00:08:15,079
Don't you already have a regular job?

79
00:08:16,240 --> 00:08:18,160
Aren't your salary and bonuses enough?

80
00:08:18,560 --> 00:08:20,160
Where's your money? Where did it go?

81
00:08:21,639 --> 00:08:23,279
I fell for a friend's pyramid scheme,

82
00:08:24,959 --> 00:08:26,120
and even got scammed out of my phone.

83
00:08:34,120 --> 00:08:35,039
Come with me.

84
00:10:07,679 --> 00:10:09,200
You rented the car, right?

85
00:10:11,519 --> 00:10:12,360
Which unit are you with?

86
00:10:12,360 --> 00:10:13,960
Number ending in 8935 is yours, right?

87
00:10:16,440 --> 00:10:17,120
Take it or leave it.

88
00:10:18,240 --> 00:10:19,440
Hold on, yeah, I rented it.

89
00:10:19,440 --> 00:10:20,519
Where did you come from?

90
00:10:20,519 --> 00:10:22,200
Minzhong No. 1 Car Rental.

91
00:10:22,399 --> 00:10:23,759
You're the one who called us.

92
00:10:23,759 --> 00:10:25,159
I asked for a Cherokee.

93
00:10:25,159 --> 00:10:26,320
Why did you switch it to a 212?

94
00:10:26,320 --> 00:10:27,279
It is a Cherokee.

95
00:10:27,480 --> 00:10:28,159
It's around back.

96
00:10:28,399 --> 00:10:29,279
I'll take you there.

97
00:10:32,039 --> 00:10:32,879
Right, this is it.

98
00:10:33,000 --> 00:10:34,000
8395?

99
00:10:34,360 --> 00:10:35,159
Yeah, this car.

100
00:10:35,559 --> 00:10:35,759
This...

101
00:10:35,759 --> 00:10:37,240
Check the car's condition.

102
00:10:39,159 --> 00:10:40,440
Do you have any idea who I am?

103
00:10:40,759 --> 00:10:41,480
I'm on a mission!

104
00:10:41,480 --> 00:10:41,919
Shut up.

105
00:10:42,279 --> 00:10:42,679
Drive.

106
00:10:56,159 --> 00:10:57,840
You're very special, you know?

107
00:10:57,960 --> 00:11:00,240
You have the right time, place, and people,

108
00:11:00,240 --> 00:11:02,000
and plenty of chances to make your mark.

109
00:11:16,200 --> 00:11:18,759
Are you here to report on your work?

110
00:11:27,360 --> 00:11:28,080
Working tirelessly,

111
00:11:28,720 --> 00:11:29,600
diligent and devoted,

112
00:11:30,120 --> 00:11:31,240
giving your absolute all...

113
00:11:32,399 --> 00:11:33,080
Tell me.

114
00:11:34,240 --> 00:11:35,279
Who were you surveilling?

115
00:11:36,960 --> 00:11:37,879
Who is the spy?

116
00:11:41,600 --> 00:11:42,799
Still don't get it?

117
00:11:43,480 --> 00:11:45,559
He's an absolute fraud.

118
00:11:45,559 --> 00:11:47,000
A fake soldier.

119
00:11:47,000 --> 00:11:47,799
You wouldn't believe me,

120
00:11:47,799 --> 00:11:48,960
and chose to believe

121
00:11:48,960 --> 00:11:49,840
a sick junkie,

122
00:11:49,840 --> 00:11:51,360
a con artist full of delusions.

123
00:11:55,480 --> 00:11:57,559
Why did you let yourself end up like this?

124
00:12:05,879 --> 00:12:06,879
Brother Shan! Brother Shan!

125
00:12:07,600 --> 00:12:08,360
Which room?

126
00:12:09,200 --> 00:12:10,399
What? You mean the interrogation?

127
00:12:10,480 --> 00:12:11,440
Wasn't Jin Chizhong arrested?

128
00:12:11,440 --> 00:12:12,799
I heard as soon as I got back.

129
00:12:13,360 --> 00:12:14,120
Did you forget about me?

130
00:12:14,720 --> 00:12:15,840
Didn't Old Wei tell you?

131
00:12:17,279 --> 00:12:18,360
No, he didn't.

132
00:12:19,879 --> 00:12:21,399
Anyway, that's what higher-ups arranged.

133
00:12:21,399 --> 00:12:23,000
Ma Qi and I are doing the interrogation.

134
00:12:23,000 --> 00:12:24,360
Go ask Old Wei.

135
00:12:25,240 --> 00:12:26,320
Brother Shan, I have something...

136
00:12:31,320 --> 00:12:32,759
Never mind. You go ahead.

137
00:12:58,279 --> 00:12:58,799
Hold on.

138
00:13:04,399 --> 00:13:04,840
Comrade...

139
00:13:04,840 --> 00:13:05,559
Shut up.

140
00:13:06,279 --> 00:13:07,519
Did I say you could speak?

141
00:13:08,000 --> 00:13:08,919
Almost done.

142
00:13:15,720 --> 00:13:17,840
I think I left my pen next door.

143
00:13:17,840 --> 00:13:19,240
Did you? I thought you brought it.

144
00:13:19,440 --> 00:13:20,039
I didn't.

145
00:13:20,519 --> 00:13:21,200
You did.

146
00:13:21,440 --> 00:13:22,519
Check your pockets.

147
00:13:23,519 --> 00:13:24,720
See? Told you I didn't.

148
00:13:25,720 --> 00:13:26,519
Did you drop it?

149
00:13:27,200 --> 00:13:27,720
Did anyone tell you to speak?

150
00:13:27,720 --> 00:13:28,440
Shut up.

151
00:13:33,399 --> 00:13:35,080
I just sat down, couldn't have dropped it.

152
00:13:35,759 --> 00:13:36,759
Go grab it from next door.

153
00:13:37,000 --> 00:13:37,519
Go on.

154
00:13:43,080 --> 00:13:43,600
Comrade, can I—

155
00:13:43,600 --> 00:13:44,080
Wait.

156
00:13:44,759 --> 00:13:45,399
According to regulations,

157
00:13:45,399 --> 00:13:47,080
two officers must be present to begin.

158
00:13:47,519 --> 00:13:48,159
Wait a bit longer.

159
00:13:53,279 --> 00:13:54,320
Found it already?

160
00:13:54,519 --> 00:13:55,039
Brother Qi.

161
00:13:56,320 --> 00:13:57,000
What are you doing here?

162
00:13:57,679 --> 00:13:58,679
Covering for Brother Shan for a bit.

163
00:13:59,120 --> 00:13:59,600
Comrade.

164
00:14:00,240 --> 00:14:01,720
I know you're from the Municipal State Security Bureau.

165
00:14:01,720 --> 00:14:03,360
Which division? What's your rank?

166
00:14:03,360 --> 00:14:04,519
Call your superior.

167
00:14:04,639 --> 00:14:06,279
Get someone on a Senior Colonel's level.

168
00:14:07,279 --> 00:14:08,720
I will not accept an apology today.

169
00:14:08,960 --> 00:14:09,440
Absolutely not!

170
00:14:09,799 --> 00:14:11,039
You've got the wrong guy, you hear me?

171
00:14:11,440 --> 00:14:13,159
Need me to explain the correction process?

172
00:14:17,799 --> 00:14:19,159
I'm talking to you!

173
00:14:19,159 --> 00:14:20,399
Get your leader in here.

174
00:14:20,399 --> 00:14:22,039
This misunderstanding isn't blowing over!

175
00:14:22,039 --> 00:14:23,919
You're in serious trouble, understand?

176
00:14:23,919 --> 00:14:25,679
Don't think you have people above

177
00:14:25,679 --> 00:14:27,279
willing to cover up something this big.

178
00:14:28,279 --> 00:14:29,519
I'll say this one last time.

179
00:14:29,679 --> 00:14:31,399
Call your bureau and division chiefs over!

180
00:14:31,399 --> 00:14:32,759
Who is your deputy bureau chief in charge?

181
00:14:32,960 --> 00:14:33,799
Tell him to double-time it here!

182
00:14:33,799 --> 00:14:34,879
Right now! Immediately!

183
00:14:36,399 --> 00:14:37,200
Are you crazy?

184
00:14:37,879 --> 00:14:38,720
Brother Qi!

185
00:14:39,720 --> 00:14:40,279
You're finished!

186
00:14:40,279 --> 00:14:41,519
Criminal Law of the PRC,

187
00:14:41,519 --> 00:14:42,279
Article 368!

188
00:14:42,279 --> 00:14:42,840
Brother Qi!

189
00:14:43,039 --> 00:14:43,919
Assaulting active-duty personnel...

190
00:14:43,919 --> 00:14:44,759
Ma Qi, what are you doing?

191
00:14:44,759 --> 00:14:45,480
Have you lost your mind?

192
00:14:45,480 --> 00:14:46,840
Keep this up and you'll face discipline!

193
00:14:46,919 --> 00:14:47,440
Calm down.

194
00:14:47,440 --> 00:14:48,600
He's just a nobody.

195
00:14:48,919 --> 00:14:49,960
Not worth me losing my head over.

196
00:14:50,200 --> 00:14:51,559
The situation report is already written.

197
00:14:52,799 --> 00:14:54,159
I'll submit it after we interrogate him.

198
00:14:59,639 --> 00:15:01,159
Your mental fortitude is truly solid.

199
00:15:01,519 --> 00:15:02,799
Everything else is fake.

200
00:15:03,559 --> 00:15:04,360
Well?

201
00:15:04,360 --> 00:15:05,600
Brainwashing people every day,

202
00:15:05,600 --> 00:15:06,679
and lying to yourself too.

203
00:15:07,039 --> 00:15:08,399
Did you really begin to believe you're

204
00:15:08,399 --> 00:15:09,919
from a secret military department?

205
00:15:09,919 --> 00:15:11,279
Were you bullied a lot as a kid?

206
00:15:11,600 --> 00:15:12,840
Is that why you wanted to be a cop?

207
00:15:13,759 --> 00:15:15,120
Took the police exam from trade school,

208
00:15:15,120 --> 00:15:16,279
blew the Chinese test,

209
00:15:16,279 --> 00:15:17,360
and missed the cutoff by two points.

210
00:15:17,519 --> 00:15:19,000
Had no choice but to work at a distillery.

211
00:15:19,240 --> 00:15:20,559
Even their security section rejected you.

212
00:15:20,799 --> 00:15:22,639
Drank your sorrows away and got fired.

213
00:15:22,960 --> 00:15:24,000
Desperate to wear a uniform,

214
00:15:24,000 --> 00:15:25,480
so you put on a fake one instead.

215
00:15:25,720 --> 00:15:27,559
Those fake seals and case files at home...

216
00:15:27,559 --> 00:15:28,600
They're all so poorly made.

217
00:15:28,879 --> 00:15:30,360
Yet few people could tell the difference.

218
00:15:30,919 --> 00:15:32,279
You even had your own routine.

219
00:15:32,519 --> 00:15:33,480
Repeat a lie often enough,

220
00:15:33,919 --> 00:15:34,559
right?

221
00:15:36,320 --> 00:15:37,080
You step outside first.

222
00:15:43,159 --> 00:15:44,759
You conned one person after another,

223
00:15:44,759 --> 00:15:47,200
having business owners vouch for you.

224
00:15:47,639 --> 00:15:49,639
You'd meet people outside military bases

225
00:15:49,639 --> 00:15:51,279
or at guesthouses near military commands.

226
00:15:51,559 --> 00:15:53,000
More and more people came to know you.

227
00:15:53,720 --> 00:15:55,000
Word spread from one person to another,

228
00:15:55,679 --> 00:15:57,440
until the lie gradually became reality.

229
00:15:57,639 --> 00:15:58,960
In the People's Liberation Army,

230
00:15:59,080 --> 00:16:00,399
leading a classified department...

231
00:16:00,600 --> 00:16:01,639
You can't just pin on a badge

232
00:16:01,639 --> 00:16:03,039
and play the part until retirement.

233
00:16:04,000 --> 00:16:04,600
What is this?

234
00:16:05,559 --> 00:16:06,320
Delusions?

235
00:16:06,759 --> 00:16:08,679
Did you never think you'd get caught?

236
00:16:11,559 --> 00:16:12,120
Tell us.

237
00:16:12,639 --> 00:16:13,440
How much money did you swindle?

238
00:16:13,919 --> 00:16:14,840
I didn't swindle any money.

239
00:16:15,639 --> 00:16:17,120
I only deceived them to get work done.

240
00:16:17,279 --> 00:16:18,399
I was catching spies!

241
00:16:19,240 --> 00:16:19,799
Really!

242
00:16:19,960 --> 00:16:21,720
You can check the files I kept.

243
00:16:21,720 --> 00:16:22,759
Everything is categorized!

244
00:16:22,759 --> 00:16:23,799
I'm not a fraud!

245
00:16:23,799 --> 00:16:25,399
I really did intelligence analysis.

246
00:16:25,399 --> 00:16:27,240
I was always ready to turn it in,

247
00:16:27,240 --> 00:16:28,399
to hand it over to you!

248
00:16:29,360 --> 00:16:30,559
I'm not a fraud!

249
00:16:32,039 --> 00:16:33,159
I'm not a fraud!

250
00:18:22,519 --> 00:18:24,160
Don't you think that Jin Chizhong

251
00:18:24,359 --> 00:18:26,079
actually has a knack for intel work?

252
00:18:28,400 --> 00:18:29,359
He's not a professional,

253
00:18:29,720 --> 00:18:31,799
but he's a con artist cut out for this.

254
00:18:52,880 --> 00:18:54,960
Brother Qi, you're up so early.

255
00:18:55,559 --> 00:18:56,960
Tired and sleepy.

256
00:18:58,200 --> 00:18:58,720
Brother Qi.

257
00:18:59,039 --> 00:19:01,480
I saw a place selling Laohua rice noodles.

258
00:19:02,279 --> 00:19:03,119
I'll go grab some.

259
00:19:04,079 --> 00:19:04,839
I'm on a diet.

260
00:19:09,559 --> 00:19:10,519
Then have something to drink.

261
00:19:11,079 --> 00:19:13,160
Working day and night will wear you out.

262
00:19:15,519 --> 00:19:17,079
If you keep skipping breakfast,

263
00:19:17,079 --> 00:19:18,599
you'll easily get gallstones.

264
00:19:18,599 --> 00:19:19,680
During the last checkup,

265
00:19:19,960 --> 00:19:21,920
over a dozen in the bureau had stones.

266
00:19:22,319 --> 00:19:23,720
They said it's usually fine,

267
00:19:24,079 --> 00:19:25,599
but when it hurts, you can't even stand.

268
00:19:43,960 --> 00:19:45,240
Actually, about Ah Cai,

269
00:19:45,559 --> 00:19:47,000
I was going to tell you,

270
00:19:47,839 --> 00:19:48,920
but at the meeting that day,

271
00:19:48,920 --> 00:19:50,799
Old Wei criticized you and you walked out.

272
00:19:51,319 --> 00:19:53,160
I was afraid the intel would be outdated,

273
00:19:53,519 --> 00:19:54,720
so I told Old Wei first.

274
00:20:09,079 --> 00:20:09,599
I'm here.

275
00:20:11,559 --> 00:20:12,079
We'll talk in person.

276
00:20:15,279 --> 00:20:16,839
How do I know who he is if we don't meet?

277
00:20:18,400 --> 00:20:18,880
Don't argue with me.

278
00:20:19,400 --> 00:20:19,880
We'll talk in person.

279
00:20:20,480 --> 00:20:21,839
If there's any problem, forget the meeting.

280
00:20:22,680 --> 00:20:23,480
Pass the message along.

281
00:20:38,440 --> 00:20:39,160
Boss.

282
00:20:40,519 --> 00:20:41,240
Yeah.

283
00:20:42,000 --> 00:20:43,240
Yeah, I'm here.

284
00:20:44,680 --> 00:20:46,200
There's an auto repair shop here.

285
00:20:47,480 --> 00:20:48,000
Right.

286
00:20:51,200 --> 00:20:52,200
Okay, got it.

287
00:22:03,880 --> 00:22:04,480
Brother Qi.

288
00:22:04,799 --> 00:22:06,079
There are coins on top of the box.

289
00:22:07,839 --> 00:22:08,960
There's definitely something fishy inside.

290
00:22:09,279 --> 00:22:09,880
What's the plan?

291
00:22:11,680 --> 00:22:12,960
Why don't you call Ah Cai and ask?

292
00:22:12,960 --> 00:22:13,759
"What's the plan?"

293
00:22:23,119 --> 00:22:24,599
His counter-surveillance skills are sharp.

294
00:22:25,119 --> 00:22:27,079
It doesn't look like anyone has been here.

295
00:22:27,079 --> 00:22:28,680
What kind of guy do you think Ah Cai is?

296
00:22:28,920 --> 00:22:30,119
Is he being used by Taiwan, China,

297
00:22:30,400 --> 00:22:31,880
or did he approach them voluntarily?

298
00:22:31,880 --> 00:22:33,400
I saw plenty of SIM cards at his place.

299
00:22:33,400 --> 00:22:34,519
Many of them haven't even been used.

300
00:22:34,519 --> 00:22:35,799
Is he waiting for orders,

301
00:22:35,799 --> 00:22:37,039
or is he just

302
00:22:37,039 --> 00:22:38,720
a small fry tasked with buying SIM cards?

303
00:22:39,279 --> 00:22:39,920
If you were him,

304
00:22:39,920 --> 00:22:41,440
what would you hide in the box?

305
00:22:41,559 --> 00:22:43,079
Either leave it empty as a bluff,

306
00:22:43,319 --> 00:22:45,240
or stash all the valuables inside

307
00:22:45,440 --> 00:22:46,039
and take a gamble.

308
00:22:46,039 --> 00:22:47,680
Aren't you tired of overanalyzing it all?

309
00:22:47,960 --> 00:22:49,680
Finding clues isn't about technique.

310
00:22:49,680 --> 00:22:50,640
It's about brains.

311
00:22:50,759 --> 00:22:51,519
That's what you said.

312
00:22:51,680 --> 00:22:53,160
Out of the hundred things I've said,

313
00:22:53,480 --> 00:22:54,519
you just had to pick this one?

314
00:22:55,160 --> 00:22:56,799
Leave that preaching back in the office.

315
00:22:57,079 --> 00:22:58,400
We only had half an hour earlier.

316
00:22:58,400 --> 00:22:59,759
Instead of rushing to open the box,

317
00:22:59,759 --> 00:23:01,000
you were letting your mind wander.

318
00:23:09,680 --> 00:23:11,200
Process is as important as the outcome.

319
00:23:11,400 --> 00:23:12,440
Then where's your outcome?

320
00:23:12,920 --> 00:23:13,839
We have nothing right now.

321
00:23:14,279 --> 00:23:15,720
When Ah Cai walked past the car earlier,

322
00:23:15,799 --> 00:23:16,839
he was on the phone the entire time.

323
00:23:17,000 --> 00:23:18,319
If I don't see him, how can I size him up?

324
00:23:19,000 --> 00:23:21,160
Plus, he ended every sentence with "mai."

325
00:23:21,599 --> 00:23:22,680
You had me memorize

326
00:23:22,680 --> 00:23:23,680
the regional accents across Minzhong.

327
00:23:23,680 --> 00:23:24,839
If I remember correctly,

328
00:23:24,839 --> 00:23:26,720
Qingquan County has a Luquan Township.

329
00:23:26,720 --> 00:23:28,119
That's how people talk over there.

330
00:23:28,319 --> 00:23:28,880
So what?

331
00:23:31,240 --> 00:23:32,839
Shouldn't we check his hometown

332
00:23:32,880 --> 00:23:34,279
to see if he hid anything there?

333
00:23:34,279 --> 00:23:35,759
Like intelligence or operational funds?

334
00:23:36,319 --> 00:23:37,039
And then?

335
00:23:37,960 --> 00:23:38,799
What do you think?

336
00:23:40,839 --> 00:23:42,480
Then you can just keep tailing him.

337
00:23:42,480 --> 00:23:44,319
You're capable enough to work solo now.

338
00:23:45,039 --> 00:23:46,039
What do you mean?

339
00:23:46,279 --> 00:23:47,160
I've already applied

340
00:23:47,160 --> 00:23:48,279
for a transfer to another task force.

341
00:23:49,200 --> 00:23:50,200
Following your example,

342
00:23:50,200 --> 00:23:52,319
sucking up to the leadership.

343
00:23:54,000 --> 00:23:55,400
Today is our last day as partners.

344
00:23:56,279 --> 00:23:58,640
I wish you all the best from now on.

345
00:24:00,039 --> 00:24:00,880
Where are you going?

346
00:24:01,319 --> 00:24:02,799
Don't follow me from now on.

347
00:24:03,599 --> 00:24:04,680
Wait, there's one more thing.

348
00:24:04,680 --> 00:24:06,000
Haven't I made myself clear enough?

349
00:24:06,000 --> 00:24:09,319
Bypass me and ask the leadership.

350
00:24:12,720 --> 00:24:14,400
Jinlan and I are getting married.

351
00:24:15,319 --> 00:24:16,400
The organization has already approved it.

352
00:24:16,839 --> 00:24:17,839
Thanks for your advice.

353
00:24:18,200 --> 00:24:19,440
We sincerely invite you.

354
00:24:24,920 --> 00:24:25,720
I will definitely be there.

355
00:24:46,400 --> 00:24:47,359
Here, have some wedding candy.

356
00:24:47,680 --> 00:24:48,680
Congratulations!

357
00:24:49,039 --> 00:24:49,960
Happy wedding!

358
00:24:50,880 --> 00:24:52,640
Here's yours. Good things come in pairs.

359
00:24:52,640 --> 00:24:53,759
Congratulations!

360
00:25:05,119 --> 00:25:05,640
Ah Tai.

361
00:25:05,640 --> 00:25:06,359
Have some wedding candy.

362
00:25:06,359 --> 00:25:07,400
Congratulations, Chunxiao!

363
00:25:07,640 --> 00:25:08,160
Thanks.

364
00:25:08,359 --> 00:25:09,039
Chunxiao.

365
00:25:09,039 --> 00:25:09,440
Brother Tong.

366
00:25:09,440 --> 00:25:10,519
Happy wedding! Happy wedding!

367
00:25:10,519 --> 00:25:11,079
Thanks, Brother Tong.

368
00:25:12,640 --> 00:25:13,599
Here, this is for you.

369
00:25:13,599 --> 00:25:14,240
Congratulations.

370
00:25:15,920 --> 00:25:16,640
Here, take some.

371
00:25:17,559 --> 00:25:18,000
Good things come in pairs.

372
00:25:18,000 --> 00:25:19,799
Congrats, Brother Xiao! Happy wedding!

373
00:25:20,119 --> 00:25:20,839
Good things come in pairs.

374
00:25:21,119 --> 00:25:22,440
Congratulations, Chunxiao!

375
00:25:22,440 --> 00:25:23,720
Wishing you a long marriage and a baby!

376
00:25:23,720 --> 00:25:24,480
Good things come in pairs!

377
00:25:24,480 --> 00:25:25,200
Congratulations! Congratulations!

378
00:25:26,880 --> 00:25:28,960
Congratulations to you!

379
00:25:31,079 --> 00:25:31,680
Wonderful news!

380
00:25:31,680 --> 00:25:32,440
Brother Li, here's yours.

381
00:25:33,119 --> 00:25:33,640
Xiaohe.

382
00:25:33,960 --> 00:25:35,799
Congratulations! Have a baby soon.

383
00:25:37,480 --> 00:25:38,319
You're too kind, Sis.

384
00:25:38,319 --> 00:25:40,240
It's hard for women in our line of work.

385
00:25:40,240 --> 00:25:41,640
With Jinlan, you must...

386
00:25:41,640 --> 00:25:44,759
take care of her, be patient, and step up.

387
00:25:45,119 --> 00:25:45,640
Definitely.

388
00:25:46,839 --> 00:25:48,079
What about wedding candy for the bosses?

389
00:25:48,160 --> 00:25:48,960
Of course, plenty here.

390
00:25:48,960 --> 00:25:49,720
Here you go.

391
00:25:51,000 --> 00:25:52,000
Congratulations.

392
00:25:53,759 --> 00:25:54,720
Thank you, thank you.

393
00:25:54,720 --> 00:25:56,599
Welcome to the dual-officer family.

394
00:25:56,599 --> 00:25:57,559
When do we get to have wedding drinks?

395
00:25:57,799 --> 00:25:59,119
I'll treat everyone once we get time off.

396
00:25:59,559 --> 00:26:00,200
Be sure to let me know.

397
00:26:00,440 --> 00:26:00,960
Definitely.

398
00:26:01,759 --> 00:26:03,680
By the way, didn't Brother Qi come today?

399
00:26:03,680 --> 00:26:04,720
He's been here for a while.

400
00:26:06,079 --> 00:26:07,319
He should be in the conference room.

401
00:26:10,279 --> 00:26:10,880
Do you think I don't know...

402
00:26:10,880 --> 00:26:12,200
what the ICU is for?

403
00:26:12,319 --> 00:26:14,319
There's no point talking about this now.

404
00:26:14,480 --> 00:26:15,279
Listen to me.

405
00:26:15,599 --> 00:26:17,000
We don't understand medicine.

406
00:26:17,000 --> 00:26:18,480
If we don't, we listen to the doctors.

407
00:26:18,480 --> 00:26:19,960
I doubt the Provincial Hospital chief

408
00:26:19,960 --> 00:26:21,599
would trick us about something like this.

409
00:26:23,440 --> 00:26:25,759
Don't listen to my brother and sister.

410
00:26:25,759 --> 00:26:26,759
Are they doctors?

411
00:26:27,400 --> 00:26:28,440
Let's stabilize her condition first.

412
00:26:28,839 --> 00:26:30,160
We can decide on the surgery tomorrow.

413
00:26:30,400 --> 00:26:31,279
Just do as I say.

414
00:26:37,720 --> 00:26:38,319
Brother Qi.

415
00:26:38,599 --> 00:26:39,240
The door was open.

416
00:26:39,240 --> 00:26:40,920
I didn't mean to overhear your call.

417
00:26:43,839 --> 00:26:44,759
It's not top secret.

418
00:26:45,079 --> 00:26:46,200
No harm done if you heard it.

419
00:26:47,680 --> 00:26:49,480
How is everything at the hospital?

420
00:26:49,680 --> 00:26:50,400
Pretty good.

421
00:26:50,599 --> 00:26:51,559
She's an elderly woman,

422
00:26:51,559 --> 00:26:52,640
and at her age,

423
00:26:52,960 --> 00:26:54,319
she's doing much better than I expected.

424
00:26:55,279 --> 00:26:57,079
Let me know if you need any help.

425
00:27:00,200 --> 00:27:01,680
I need you to enjoy your honeymoon,

426
00:27:02,440 --> 00:27:03,039
and cherish...

427
00:27:03,039 --> 00:27:05,039
the bit of bliss you have right now.

428
00:27:05,200 --> 00:27:06,319
Later, when you're constantly away,

429
00:27:06,319 --> 00:27:07,960
your wife will definitely fight with you.

430
00:27:08,480 --> 00:27:09,839
Dating and marriage are totally different.

431
00:27:10,039 --> 00:27:10,880
Take care of yourself.

432
00:27:11,920 --> 00:27:12,599
Thanks.

433
00:27:13,119 --> 00:27:13,680
By the way,

434
00:27:14,119 --> 00:27:15,119
that's for you.

435
00:27:15,119 --> 00:27:15,920
Take it when you leave work.

436
00:27:18,240 --> 00:27:19,839
Brother Qi gave quite a generous gift!

437
00:27:19,839 --> 00:27:21,880
Wow, how much did this cost?

438
00:27:22,359 --> 00:27:24,680
Ultra color-correcting, and it's Blu-ray?

439
00:27:24,960 --> 00:27:25,799
How do you know?

440
00:27:26,359 --> 00:27:27,559
Sis, you've got to keep up with the times.

441
00:27:27,559 --> 00:27:28,480
This is super popular right now.

442
00:27:28,480 --> 00:27:29,400
Money can't even buy it.

443
00:27:29,400 --> 00:27:31,359
Not a single Chinese word on this.

444
00:27:31,359 --> 00:27:32,440
I can read English!

445
00:27:32,559 --> 00:27:34,160
That's a truly thoughtful gesture.

446
00:27:34,160 --> 00:27:34,960
You bet.

447
00:28:16,640 --> 00:28:17,519
Long time no see.

448
00:28:42,000 --> 00:28:43,240
Here comes the food!

449
00:28:58,480 --> 00:29:00,400
Back in college, I was in the drama club.

450
00:29:00,720 --> 00:29:02,839
Our teacher said a play needs closure.

451
00:29:03,359 --> 00:29:04,279
Either don't open the scene,

452
00:29:04,559 --> 00:29:05,640
or bring the story to a proper close.

453
00:29:05,839 --> 00:29:08,440
You marry, and your love rival shows up.

454
00:29:09,839 --> 00:29:11,359
The couple has a lovers' spat.

455
00:29:11,519 --> 00:29:12,839
And I vanish without a trace.

456
00:29:13,240 --> 00:29:14,079
Flawless logic.

457
00:29:14,559 --> 00:29:15,279
Completely plausible.

458
00:29:24,400 --> 00:29:25,839
They never told me you were coming.

459
00:29:26,440 --> 00:29:27,240
I didn't expect it either.

460
00:29:28,960 --> 00:29:30,200
How long has it been since we last met?

461
00:29:31,680 --> 00:29:34,119
I thought you were no longer in this city.

462
00:29:36,559 --> 00:29:37,759
If I were Lin Kanshan,

463
00:29:38,599 --> 00:29:39,920
I wouldn't be able to tell we're acting.

464
00:29:41,119 --> 00:29:42,079
You can't fake genuine shock.

465
00:29:44,039 --> 00:29:45,759
What about you? How've you been lately?

466
00:29:45,960 --> 00:29:46,640
Did you get married?

467
00:29:47,640 --> 00:29:49,359
Almost. Didn't work out in the end.

468
00:29:51,039 --> 00:29:52,759
Isn't that how most things in life go?

469
00:29:53,680 --> 00:29:54,400
All for nothing.

470
00:29:55,839 --> 00:29:58,400
Some things only happen if you push hard.

471
00:29:58,960 --> 00:30:00,799
I remember when I first joined the bureau.

472
00:30:01,799 --> 00:30:03,559
I'd read case files until midnight.

473
00:30:03,759 --> 00:30:05,000
I thought I was the only one.

474
00:30:05,440 --> 00:30:06,359
Then I realized you were there too.

475
00:30:06,960 --> 00:30:09,279
Look at all those cases in the files.

476
00:30:09,599 --> 00:30:11,039
Which wasn't cracked with blood and sweat?

477
00:30:19,359 --> 00:30:20,559
Have you ever felt...

478
00:30:22,000 --> 00:30:23,160
...that I'm a bit obsessive?

479
00:30:24,599 --> 00:30:26,960
Like when I insisted on suspecting you?

480
00:30:29,559 --> 00:30:30,240
Let's not bring that up.

481
00:30:31,000 --> 00:30:31,559
It's all in the past.

482
00:30:34,640 --> 00:30:36,039
I'm not here to apologize to you.

483
00:30:37,200 --> 00:30:38,200
If I could suspect you,

484
00:30:38,759 --> 00:30:39,759
I can suspect others too.

485
00:30:41,480 --> 00:30:42,279
It's agonizing for me too.

486
00:30:42,799 --> 00:30:43,759
Tell me, what should I do?

487
00:30:46,359 --> 00:30:47,200
Who else do you suspect?

488
00:30:49,039 --> 00:30:50,240
I've been in the Technical Section,

489
00:30:50,839 --> 00:30:52,039
working at another facility,

490
00:30:52,720 --> 00:30:54,319
helping Jinlan crack passwords.

491
00:30:55,240 --> 00:30:57,279
Everything I've learned over the years...

492
00:30:57,640 --> 00:30:58,680
...I just passed it all on to her.

493
00:30:59,559 --> 00:31:00,960
I think there's a problem in our ranks.

494
00:31:03,160 --> 00:31:04,559
But I might be sent overseas soon.

495
00:31:04,759 --> 00:31:05,559
When are you leaving?

496
00:31:06,119 --> 00:31:06,880
Standard procedure.

497
00:31:07,359 --> 00:31:09,640
We're notified the day before departure.

498
00:31:10,680 --> 00:31:11,880
I've been trying to convince myself

499
00:31:12,279 --> 00:31:13,200
not to suspect a colleague.

500
00:31:13,799 --> 00:31:15,559
Especially after what happened with you.

501
00:31:16,160 --> 00:31:17,160
But I can't help it.

502
00:31:18,759 --> 00:31:20,039
I think he's compromised.

503
00:31:21,480 --> 00:31:22,359
I've felt it for a long time.

504
00:31:25,799 --> 00:31:27,200
Yet I have no solid proof.

505
00:31:30,359 --> 00:31:32,599
You're leaving, so you're telling me.

506
00:31:33,519 --> 00:31:35,359
You want me to suspect and keep digging.

507
00:31:39,759 --> 00:31:40,920
I still need to pack my things.

508
00:31:41,799 --> 00:31:42,839
Let's leave it at that.

509
00:31:42,839 --> 00:31:43,359
Take care.

510
00:31:45,720 --> 00:31:46,240
Let's shake hands.

511
00:31:50,839 --> 00:31:52,279
Lin Kanshan might be watching.

512
00:31:52,960 --> 00:31:53,880
No handshakes.

513
00:31:56,880 --> 00:31:59,359
You and I are love rivals.

514
00:32:00,599 --> 00:32:01,400
We're adversaries.

515
00:32:02,759 --> 00:32:04,359
Locked in a delicate rivalry.

516
00:32:05,000 --> 00:32:06,000
You didn't go home,

517
00:32:06,759 --> 00:32:07,920
and I came running over myself.

518
00:32:08,599 --> 00:32:11,480
You're upset, and I'm not thrilled either.

519
00:32:12,440 --> 00:32:13,960
Two men sitting down for a drink,

520
00:32:14,799 --> 00:32:16,160
venting petty grievances.

521
00:32:16,960 --> 00:32:17,680
That fits our roles.

522
00:32:18,720 --> 00:32:19,720
Maybe when you get back, you'll have to

523
00:32:19,720 --> 00:32:21,519
argue with Jinlan so neighbors hear.

524
00:32:24,960 --> 00:32:25,799
You don't know me.

525
00:32:27,359 --> 00:32:28,400
I don't like arguing.

526
00:32:29,279 --> 00:32:30,519
No matter how wronged I feel,

527
00:32:30,519 --> 00:32:31,519
I keep it buried deep inside.

528
00:32:31,720 --> 00:32:32,759
I won't say a single word.

529
00:32:41,039 --> 00:32:41,839
Right.

530
00:32:43,680 --> 00:32:45,039
If you can't stomach being wronged,

531
00:32:46,599 --> 00:32:47,440
you won't last in this line of work.

532
00:32:49,759 --> 00:32:51,160
How the script of life is written...

533
00:32:52,440 --> 00:32:53,240
...who knows?

534
00:32:55,599 --> 00:32:56,839
Just live in the moment.

535
00:33:01,480 --> 00:33:02,279
I'm off.

536
00:33:05,559 --> 00:33:06,359
Happy wedding.

537
00:33:43,680 --> 00:33:45,119
Did you hear something?

538
00:33:45,920 --> 00:33:47,359
Is someone smashing things?

539
00:33:52,000 --> 00:33:53,240
I'm talking to you.

540
00:33:53,720 --> 00:33:54,960
Is someone breaking something?

541
00:34:06,599 --> 00:34:07,480
What's wrong?

542
00:34:08,760 --> 00:34:09,440
Period cramps.

543
00:34:10,199 --> 00:34:11,199
We've only been married for a few days,

544
00:34:11,199 --> 00:34:12,719
and you already brought someone home.

545
00:34:13,920 --> 00:34:15,679
Something's off with Lin Kanshan's phone.

546
00:34:15,679 --> 00:34:16,599
It's been almost a week.

547
00:34:16,599 --> 00:34:17,920
He rarely makes outgoing calls.

548
00:34:17,920 --> 00:34:20,119
Not even routine calls to his Taipei dad.

549
00:34:20,360 --> 00:34:21,679
He must have another device.

550
00:34:21,679 --> 00:34:22,800
Could it be a Phone cloner?

551
00:34:24,519 --> 00:34:26,079
Don't raise your voice at me.

552
00:34:26,079 --> 00:34:27,559
Who do you think you're talking to?

553
00:34:27,559 --> 00:34:29,000
What's wrong with the way I talk to you?

554
00:34:29,000 --> 00:34:30,480
We had a good life before this.

555
00:34:30,480 --> 00:34:31,519
Why did we even get married?

556
00:34:32,079 --> 00:34:32,840
Serves you right.

557
00:34:34,719 --> 00:34:35,960
And you think you're in the right?

558
00:34:36,760 --> 00:34:39,079
Saving on phone bills enhances security.

559
00:34:39,079 --> 00:34:40,239
Doesn't he understand that?

560
00:34:41,280 --> 00:34:43,400
If it's a day, a month, or a year,

561
00:34:43,719 --> 00:34:45,199
you can keep your guard up.

562
00:34:45,199 --> 00:34:47,280
After ten years, can anyone stay alert?

563
00:34:47,440 --> 00:34:49,360
Anyone would get sloppy and careless.

564
00:34:49,719 --> 00:34:51,880
We are married, yet you don't trust me.

565
00:34:51,880 --> 00:34:52,440
Give me a kiss.

566
00:34:52,480 --> 00:34:54,199
Is this about trust?

567
00:34:54,199 --> 00:34:55,800
You've already brought someone home.

568
00:34:55,800 --> 00:34:56,480
If I were him,

569
00:34:56,480 --> 00:34:58,039
I'd feel like everyone is watching me.

570
00:34:58,039 --> 00:34:59,199
Every single moment.

571
00:35:01,280 --> 00:35:02,280
What do you mean?

572
00:35:02,519 --> 00:35:04,119
Like how you assume everyone is a suspect,

573
00:35:04,119 --> 00:35:05,119
and you're constantly

574
00:35:05,119 --> 00:35:06,360
monitoring everyone around you.

575
00:35:07,280 --> 00:35:08,559
Do you mean Ma Qi?

576
00:35:08,559 --> 00:35:10,840
I mean your lawful new wife.

577
00:35:12,599 --> 00:35:13,360
You suspect me?

578
00:35:14,360 --> 00:35:15,159
I never expected that.

579
00:35:44,400 --> 00:35:46,639
You're ruling out me warning Lin Kanshan,

580
00:35:47,199 --> 00:35:47,920
aren't you?

581
00:35:51,639 --> 00:35:52,159
Yes.

582
00:35:52,440 --> 00:35:53,079
Fine.

583
00:35:55,119 --> 00:35:55,719
Got it.

584
00:36:00,239 --> 00:36:02,039
Lin Kanshan must have noticed something.

585
00:36:02,039 --> 00:36:03,559
I don't believe he has such intuition.

586
00:36:03,559 --> 00:36:04,760
There's no such thing as intuition.

587
00:36:04,760 --> 00:36:05,920
He must have spotted something.

588
00:36:05,920 --> 00:36:07,000
What did he find?

589
00:36:07,920 --> 00:36:08,639
I haven't found it yet.

590
00:36:08,639 --> 00:36:09,719
That's why I'm looking.

591
00:36:09,719 --> 00:36:11,199
I must question everyone there that day.

592
00:36:11,199 --> 00:36:12,360
It's my job.

593
00:36:12,360 --> 00:36:14,039
Like when you and Huadong suspected me.

594
00:36:14,039 --> 00:36:14,840
It's the same thing.

595
00:36:19,880 --> 00:36:21,000
Are you angry?

596
00:36:22,119 --> 00:36:23,440
When we suspected you back then,

597
00:36:23,679 --> 00:36:24,639
you got angry too.

598
00:36:34,119 --> 00:36:35,000
Earlier,

599
00:36:35,800 --> 00:36:37,840
did I yell too loudly when we argued?

600
00:36:38,119 --> 00:36:38,880
Look at you.

601
00:36:39,199 --> 00:36:40,480
If you were truly angry,

602
00:36:41,079 --> 00:36:42,400
you wouldn't yell at all.

603
00:36:43,079 --> 00:36:45,119
I wouldn't waste another word on you.

604
00:37:01,440 --> 00:37:02,800
You didn't get enough rest yesterday.

605
00:37:02,800 --> 00:37:04,000
Go get some sleep early tonight.

606
00:37:04,199 --> 00:37:04,920
I'll take over monitoring.

607
00:37:09,960 --> 00:37:11,119
Actually, sometimes...

608
00:37:11,519 --> 00:37:13,239
I wish we weren't in this line of work.

609
00:37:14,519 --> 00:37:15,480
Doing anything else would do.

610
00:37:16,400 --> 00:37:18,519
Like, I could be a doctor, you a nurse.

611
00:37:19,159 --> 00:37:21,119
Or we could just run a pancake stall.

612
00:37:22,000 --> 00:37:23,119
Anything at all.

613
00:37:25,719 --> 00:37:27,599
Suspicion is unavoidable, Jinlan.

614
00:37:28,079 --> 00:37:29,280
Because people change.

615
00:37:30,199 --> 00:37:31,840
From one second to the next,

616
00:37:32,360 --> 00:37:34,599
people's thoughts change every minute.

617
00:37:34,920 --> 00:37:35,840
Just like Huadong.

618
00:37:36,199 --> 00:37:38,840
Who knows how many years he'll be gone?

619
00:37:39,320 --> 00:37:40,039
Theoretically speaking,

620
00:37:40,039 --> 00:37:41,119
by the time he returns,

621
00:37:41,119 --> 00:37:42,519
I won't know if he's changed,

622
00:37:42,840 --> 00:37:44,239
and he won't know if I have.

623
00:37:44,360 --> 00:37:46,000
No one stays the same forever.

624
00:37:49,199 --> 00:37:49,760
That's right.

625
00:37:50,760 --> 00:37:52,880
Even marriage changes, let alone people.

626
00:37:53,440 --> 00:37:54,599
That's not what I meant.

627
00:37:54,599 --> 00:37:55,719
I'm not speaking out of anger.

628
00:37:56,000 --> 00:37:57,360
Once you've done wiretapping long enough,

629
00:37:58,239 --> 00:37:59,119
you'll realize that in this world,

630
00:37:59,119 --> 00:38:00,639
nothing truly lasts forever.

631
00:38:00,960 --> 00:38:01,760
It's the truth.

632
00:38:03,400 --> 00:38:05,840
Look at me, sounding so gloomy today.

633
00:38:05,840 --> 00:38:06,519
I...

634
00:38:50,760 --> 00:38:51,559
Thank you.

635
00:39:27,559 --> 00:39:29,199
Where am I going? How long will I be away?

636
00:39:29,800 --> 00:39:30,840
Somewhere tropical or cold?

637
00:39:33,039 --> 00:39:34,199
I mean...

638
00:39:35,119 --> 00:39:36,639
I just need to know what clothes to pack.

639
00:39:37,639 --> 00:39:39,039
Should I bring a coat or a down jacket?

640
00:39:40,960 --> 00:39:42,039
Can't you tell me that either?

641
00:39:42,440 --> 00:39:44,679
In ten minutes, a car will be downstairs

642
00:39:44,679 --> 00:39:45,760
to take you to the airport.

643
00:39:46,000 --> 00:39:47,000
Everything else,

644
00:39:47,000 --> 00:39:48,400
the organization will take care of.

645
00:39:48,760 --> 00:39:49,599
Any other questions?

646
00:39:52,599 --> 00:39:53,880
I want to say thank you.

647
00:39:55,480 --> 00:39:57,280
I thought you had forgotten about me.

648
00:39:59,559 --> 00:40:00,400
Thank you.

649
00:40:20,599 --> 00:40:22,360
The cafeteria food is getting worse.

650
00:40:23,119 --> 00:40:24,000
Complaining doesn't help at all.

651
00:40:24,320 --> 00:40:25,400
I'll have to get another bowl later.

652
00:40:26,039 --> 00:40:27,719
I brought you here because walls have ears.

653
00:40:28,000 --> 00:40:28,639
If I'd known,

654
00:40:29,000 --> 00:40:30,719
I'd have brought both head cooks along

655
00:40:30,719 --> 00:40:31,440
to learn a thing or two.

656
00:40:31,559 --> 00:40:32,119
Learn a thing or two here?

657
00:40:32,639 --> 00:40:34,000
And serve rice noodle soup at the bureau?

658
00:40:34,880 --> 00:40:35,920
I was just saying the food is terrible.

659
00:40:37,039 --> 00:40:38,559
Only a few matters require secrecy.

660
00:40:38,760 --> 00:40:40,760
Leak the intel we just talked about today.

661
00:40:40,760 --> 00:40:41,400
If it gets out,

662
00:40:41,679 --> 00:40:43,679
find out how it reached Taipei.

663
00:40:43,920 --> 00:40:46,039
See if it connects to Wen Zongshu's side.

664
00:40:46,320 --> 00:40:47,880
And the channel for that Phone cloner.

665
00:40:48,559 --> 00:40:49,360
The channels are easy.

666
00:40:50,079 --> 00:40:51,440
What about the guy? Do we arrest him?

667
00:40:55,280 --> 00:40:56,119
Want a marinated egg?

668
00:40:57,559 --> 00:40:58,280
Give me one.

669
00:40:59,800 --> 00:41:00,639
What about Ah Cai?

670
00:41:00,880 --> 00:41:02,239
He's not worth much.

671
00:41:02,239 --> 00:41:04,079
Should we test him once more?

672
00:41:04,559 --> 00:41:05,519
If the intel leaks,

673
00:41:05,519 --> 00:41:06,719
it's set in stone.

674
00:41:07,079 --> 00:41:08,159
Then it's time to pull in the net.

675
00:41:08,440 --> 00:41:09,079
Pull it in.

676
00:41:09,519 --> 00:41:11,079
The meal is served, why not eat?

677
00:41:13,519 --> 00:41:15,599
What's going on? Dragging us here early.

678
00:41:15,840 --> 00:41:17,000
Is there an operation?

679
00:41:17,000 --> 00:41:19,079
You'll have to ask Chunxiao.

680
00:41:19,079 --> 00:41:20,519
What did Old Wei tell you?

681
00:41:20,519 --> 00:41:21,719
What did you tell Old Wei?

682
00:41:21,719 --> 00:41:22,559
I have no idea either.

683
00:41:23,159 --> 00:41:24,679
What's up with Sis Li today?

684
00:41:24,679 --> 00:41:26,880
She's usually as punctual as a clock.

685
00:41:26,880 --> 00:41:27,880
Why isn't she here yet?

686
00:41:28,199 --> 00:41:29,920
Didn't you see her bag on the chair?

687
00:41:29,920 --> 00:41:31,119
She must have arrived early.

688
00:41:31,119 --> 00:41:32,440
You think everyone is like us?

689
00:41:32,679 --> 00:41:33,480
Everyone's here.

690
00:41:36,280 --> 00:41:39,000
Police installed 300 new cameras downtown.

691
00:41:39,000 --> 00:41:40,239
At their clearest, they can capture

692
00:41:40,239 --> 00:41:41,760
a 300-meter radius.

693
00:41:42,079 --> 00:41:44,360
Chunxiao tracked Ah Cai's recent movements.

694
00:41:44,800 --> 00:41:47,880
He visited Shaxian daily for three days.

695
00:41:48,639 --> 00:41:49,440
What's he doing there?

696
00:41:49,760 --> 00:41:50,440
Eating cured duck?

697
00:41:51,360 --> 00:41:52,559
Not just eating.

698
00:41:53,039 --> 00:41:54,360
He's working for the other side, too.

699
00:41:55,400 --> 00:41:57,079
Didn't you say you didn't know anything?

700
00:41:57,639 --> 00:41:59,519
Chunxiao almost nailed down all the leads.

701
00:41:59,760 --> 00:42:01,000
I've already sent Li Fengge

702
00:42:01,000 --> 00:42:02,719
to prepare search and arrest warrants.

703
00:42:02,920 --> 00:42:03,840
We can make the arrest now.

704
00:42:05,079 --> 00:42:05,840
Arrest him right now?

705
00:42:06,400 --> 00:42:08,239
Didn't we say we'd let this fish fatten up?

706
00:42:08,360 --> 00:42:09,880
Ah Cai isn't Wen Zongshu.

707
00:42:09,880 --> 00:42:11,719
He'd still be a worthless shrimp.

708
00:42:13,679 --> 00:42:15,639
All search and arrest docs are here.

709
00:42:16,280 --> 00:42:16,840
Good.

710
00:42:17,800 --> 00:42:19,000
We'll split into two teams.

711
00:42:19,559 --> 00:42:20,760
Ma Qi will lead the arrest team.

712
00:42:22,079 --> 00:42:22,760
Baoshan will take a team

713
00:42:22,760 --> 00:42:24,760
to Ah Cai's place to secure evidence.

714
00:42:25,199 --> 00:42:26,039
You can head out now.

715
00:42:26,400 --> 00:42:28,119
The chiefs have laid it all out clearly.

716
00:42:28,119 --> 00:42:29,199
Let's get moving, then.

717
00:42:43,280 --> 00:42:43,880
What's wrong?

718
00:42:44,400 --> 00:42:45,239
Not feeling well?

719
00:42:45,760 --> 00:42:46,440
No.

720
00:42:47,079 --> 00:42:48,239
I left in a rush this morning

721
00:42:48,679 --> 00:42:49,920
and forgot to take my medicine.

722
00:42:50,079 --> 00:42:50,639
I'm fine.

723
00:43:08,360 --> 00:43:09,440
I'm Wang Kai,

724
00:43:09,440 --> 00:43:11,159
inviting you to watch the TV series

725
00:43:11,159 --> 00:43:12,000
Confrontation.

726
00:43:12,519 --> 00:43:13,880
Hello, how much gas do you need?

727
00:43:14,159 --> 00:43:14,760
Hello?

728
00:43:14,760 --> 00:43:15,719
How much gas?

729
00:43:15,719 --> 00:43:16,920
He didn't pump any gas.

730
00:43:16,920 --> 00:43:17,840
Not good, he's trying to run!

731
00:43:17,840 --> 00:43:18,599
Quick, pull out the nozzle!

732
00:43:21,880 --> 00:43:23,119
It's all burned paper and documents.

733
00:43:23,119 --> 00:43:24,239
There's even more in the cesspool.

734
00:43:24,239 --> 00:43:25,000
He definitely destroyed

735
00:43:25,000 --> 00:43:26,360
all of this in advance.

736
00:43:26,360 --> 00:43:28,039
Someone tipped him off, definitely.

737
00:43:28,039 --> 00:43:29,280
Why is it you two again?

738
00:43:29,280 --> 00:43:30,360
What's going on here?

739
00:43:30,360 --> 00:43:31,199
We're the ones who arrested him.

740
00:43:31,199 --> 00:43:32,039
Where are you taking him?

741
00:43:32,039 --> 00:43:33,480
What right do you have to arrest people?

742
00:43:33,800 --> 00:43:34,719
We're from State Security.

743
00:43:34,719 --> 00:43:35,440
Let go! Let go!

744
00:43:35,440 --> 00:43:36,559
You have a different identity every day.

745
00:43:36,559 --> 00:43:37,599
Who knows if it's real or fake?
